<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile receives no offers for bauxite.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile receives no offers for bauxite.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it received no offers for its metallurgical grade bauxite in the offer made on Jan 28.</p>
<p>The next offer will be on Feb 25.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
